          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP414 Linden [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tonight I was out for a short adventure this way and had to stop for this. Surely about as marked as they get…1 guide post and 3 wooden stakes! Needless to say, a pretty easy find. Thanks for another brass cap.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
