          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP414 - Linden&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Out for another day of capping and caching with OBA, this time we went east!! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; This was quite a nice drive up!! Nice and green out here already! Wow! 

Except for the partly orange cap! &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_wink.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt; TFTCap!!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
