          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP414 – Linden

N 51° 35.354 W 113° 28.687&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Truly2 and I left Calgary early this morning under a heavy grey sky.  This was our first stop and there was no sunshine yet.  We would have plenty of sun once we got far enough east.  Thank you for the brass cap outforthehunt; the numbers and picture have just been sent.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
